#: package/contents/ui/OutputPanel.qml:189
#, kde-format
msgid "RGB Range:"
msgstr "Intervalo de cor:"

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:197
#, kde-format
msgid "Full"
msgstr "Completo"

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:198
#, kde-format
msgid "Limited"
msgstr "Limitado"

#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:208
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Determines whether or not the range of possible color values needs to be limit"
"ed for the display. This should only be changed if the colors on the screen lo"
"ok washed out."
msgstr ""
"Determina se limitar ou non o intervalo de valores de cores posíbeis para a pa"
"ntalla. Isto só debería cambiarse se as cores na pantalla semellan descolorida"
"s."

#. +> stable5
#: package/contents/ui/OutputPanel.qml:73
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"&quot;%1&quot; is the only resolution supported by this display.<nl/>"
"<nl/>"
"Using unsupported resolutions was possible in the Plasma X11 session, but they"
" were never guaranteed to work and are not available in this Plasma Wayland se"
"ssion."
msgstr ""
"«%1» é a única resolución que permite esta pantalla.<nl/>"
"<nl/>"
"Usar resolucións incompatíbeis era posíbel na sesión de X11 de Plasma, pero nu"
"nca se garantiu que funcionasen e non están dispoñíbeis nesta sesión de Waylan"
"d de Plasma."

