#: ui/Panel.qml:142
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The apps themselves should scale to fit the displays"
msgid "Apply scaling themselves"
msgstr "Escala de seu"

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/Panel.qml:147
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Legacy applications that support scaling will use it and look crisp, however t"
"hose that don't will not be scaled at all."
msgstr ""
"As aplicacións antigas que permitan escala usarana para verse nítidas, pero as"
" que non quedarán sen escalar."

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/Panel.qml:158
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The system will perform the x11 apps scaling"
msgid "Scaled by the system"
msgstr "Escala do sistema"

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/Panel.qml:163
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"All legacy applications will be scaled by the system to the correct size, howe"
"ver they will always look slightly blurry."
msgstr ""
"O sistema escalará todas as aplicacións antigas ao tamaño correcto, porén semp"
"re se verán un pouco borrosas."

